#: shared/resourcekolabbase.cpp:108
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"This is a Kolab Groupware object.\n"
"To view this object you will need an email client that can understand the "
"Kolab Groupware format.\n"
"For a list of such email clients please visit\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"यो कोल्याब समूहगत वस्तु हो ।\n"
"यो वस्तु हेर्न तपाईँलाई एउटा इमेल क्लाइन्ट आवश्यक छ जसले कोल्याब समूहगत ढाँचा बुझ्दछ ।\n"
"सो इमेल क्लाइन्टको सूचीका लागि कृपया\n"
"%1 हेर्नुहोस्"

#: shared/resourcekolabbase.cpp:138
msgid "Internal kolab data: Do not delete this mail."
msgstr "आन्तरिक कोल्याब लगत: यो पत्र नमेट्नुहोस् ।"

#: shared/resourcekolabbase.cpp:214
msgid ""
"No writable resource was found, saving will not be possible. Reconfigure "
"KMail first."
msgstr "कुनै लेखनयोग्य संसाधान फेला परेन, बचत सम्भव हुने छैन । पहिला केडीई मेल पुन: कन्फिगर गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: shared/resourcekolabbase.cpp:223
msgid ""
"You have more than one writable resource folder. Please select the one you "
"want to write to."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँसँग एक भन्दा बढी लेखनयोग्य संसाधान फोल्डर छ । कृपया तपाईँले लेख्न चाहनुभएको एउटा चयन "
"गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: shared/resourcekolabbase.cpp:227
msgid "Select Resource Folder"
msgstr "संसाधान फोल्डर चयन गर्नुहोस्"

